    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.4036,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 82.52,
    "end": 84.68,
    "text": "Tonight we have a fabulous show planned for you.",
    "s_text": 0.5209,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.2825,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.68,
    "end": 85.72,
    "text": "It's one of our favorites.",
    "s_text": 0.4911,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.0969,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.72,
    "end": 89.88,
    "text": "It's still working with integers as we've done before in the past but this time it's",
    "s_text": 0.5399,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.88,
    "end": 94.72,
    "text": "positive and signed fractions meaning that we're going to be working with operations with",
    "s_text": 0.684,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.72,
    "end": 99.36,
    "text": "positive and negative numbers related to those fractions.",
    "s_text": 0.4981,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.36,
    "end": 102.84,
    "text": "And those of you that are loyal watchers, you know what comes next.",
    "s_text": 0.6297,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.84,
    "end": 106.08,
    "text": "Yes, it is time for Hannah to share that challenge question.",
    "s_text": 0.6112,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.08,
    "end": 108.0,
    "text": "So we're going to take it over to Hannah.",
    "s_text": 0.6109,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 109.0,
    "text": "Well thank you Tammy.",
    "s_text": 0.386,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 109.0,
    "end": 110.52,
    "text": "Here's the challenge question everybody.",
    "s_text": 0.4397,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.0699,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.52,
    "end": 112.6,
    "text": "Take an out of it and give it a shot.",
    "s_text": 0.5862,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.6,
    "end": 115.04,
    "text": "I know you can do it.",
    "s_text": 0.6082,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.04,
    "end": 117.6,
    "text": "And here it's three, three less hollows.",
    "s_text": 0.4968,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.6,
    "end": 125.68,
    "text": "Find the sum of the two fractions that are less than one fifth and greater than one sixth",
    "s_text": 0.5549,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 125.68,
    "end": 128.04,
    "text": "with denominator 90.",
    "s_text": 0.3586,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.04,
    "end": 131.32,
    "text": "We put a little restriction there, denominator 90.",
    "s_text": 0.3524,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 131.32,
    "end": 132.6,
    "text": "So let me read it one more time.",
    "s_text": 0.5136,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.6,
    "end": 134.04,
    "text": "I hope you write it down.",
    "s_text": 0.5775,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.04,
    "end": 139.12,
    "text": "It says find the sum and we all know what the word sum is for of the two fractions that",
    "s_text": 0.7266,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.12,
    "end": 144.64,
    "text": "are less than one fifth and greater than one sixth with denominator 90.",
    "s_text": 0.3762,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.64,
    "end": 146.24,
    "text": "I know you can do it.",
    "s_text": 0.6082,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.24,
    "end": 150.2,
    "text": "And you know what to do after you get the right answer, you call the number and you would",
    "s_text": 0.5712,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.2,
    "end": 152.24,
    "text": "be probably our winner for tonight.",
    "s_text": 0.4851,
    "s_visual": 0.483,
    "visual_reliability": 0.5492,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.24,
    "end": 154.28,
    "text": "We're waiting for your call.",
    "s_text": 0.5265,
    "s_visual": 0.2,
    "visual_reliability": 0.4556,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.28,
    "end": 156.28,
    "text": "Hopefully with the right answer.",
    "s_text": 0.5466,
    "s_visual": 0.2,
    "visual_reliability": 0.323,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.28,
    "end": 157.28,
    "text": "All right.",
    "s_text": 0.3268,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.1108,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.28,
    "end": 158.28,
    "text": "Tammy.",
    "s_text": 0.2108,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.0809,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 158.28,
    "end": 159.28,
    "text": "All right.",
    "s_text": 0.3268,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.28,
    "end": 161.4,
    "text": "Bing Santa and while we're waiting for your phone calls and while you're working on that",
    "s_text": 0.6598,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 161.4,
    "end": 164.44,
    "text": "challenge question, we're going to take a look at our topic tonight and we're going",
    "s_text": 0.6465,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 164.44,
    "end": 165.44,
    "text": "to start off a little slow.",
    "s_text": 0.3558,
    "s_visual": 0.0014,
    "visual_reliability": 0.3238,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 165.44,
    "end": 169.44,
    "text": "We're going to go ahead and take it with those decimals and how they're related to fractions",
    "s_text": 0.7504,
    "s_visual": 0.2,
    "visual_reliability": 0.4426,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.44,
    "end": 172.0,
    "text": "and fractions and how they're related to decimals.",
    "s_text": 0.5785,
    "s_visual": 0.2,
    "visual_reliability": 0.2784,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.0,
    "end": 175.28,
    "text": "So let's go ahead and take a look what I have planned on our board.",
    "s_text": 0.6187,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.1879,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 175.28,
    "end": 179.56,
    "text": "Talking about fractions, there is a relationship between the fraction and the decimal.",
    "s_text": 0.544,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.0644,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.56,
    "end": 184.84,
    "text": "So when we look at four fists, we can actually divide that out and find out what its decimal",
    "s_text": 0.5917,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.84,
    "end": 186.28,
    "text": "equivalent is.",
    "s_text": 0.5555,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.28,
    "end": 192.24,
    "text": "So I always want to remind you that when you set this up, you're going to be dividing",
    "s_text": 0.6795,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.24,
    "end": 195.24,
    "text": "the five into the four.",
    "s_text": 0.4307,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.24,
    "end": 199.68,
    "text": "And as soon as you see that, you go, well, surely she knows that five won't go into four.",
    "s_text": 0.5447,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.76,
    "end": 202.24,
    "text": "Surely she knows that, of course I do.",
    "s_text": 0.4806,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 202.24,
    "end": 207.24,
    "text": "I'm going to need to put a decimal here and then you also remember that when you add",
    "s_text": 0.5905,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.24,
    "end": 211.6,
    "text": "a decimal, any zeros you add behind it, or it's not going to change the value.",
    "s_text": 0.5419,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.6,
    "end": 213.76,
    "text": "I think I've said this on the show before.",
    "s_text": 0.4599,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.76,
    "end": 219.08,
    "text": "If you're 13 years old, you don't walk around going, hi, I'm 13.0 years old.",
    "s_text": 0.4627,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.08,
    "end": 221.16,
    "text": "We know that that point zero is there.",
    "s_text": 0.5429,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.16,
    "end": 223.12,
    "text": "We just don't need to say it all the time.",
    "s_text": 0.6097,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.3105,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.12,
    "end": 226.88,
    "text": "So if we take a look at this problem and we're going to work it out, we didn't have enough",
    "s_text": 0.6245,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.2174,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.88,
    "end": 229.92,
    "text": "places to divide five into four.",
    "s_text": 0.4273,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.0746,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.92,
    "end": 234.12,
    "text": "So we're going to add a decimal, not changing the value at all, adding a zero.",
    "s_text": 0.5364,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.12,
    "end": 236.56,
    "text": "And then I'm going to go ahead and stop there because I've had a little foresight here",
    "s_text": 0.6131,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.56,
    "end": 239.76,
    "text": "and seeing that I know that five will go into 40.",
    "s_text": 0.4959,
    "s_visual": 0.1,
    "visual_reliability": 0.05,
    "teaching_stage": "semantic"
  }
]